A NOTE THAT IS NOT PART OF THE LICENCE
  This dataset is not a litigation resource. Requests to add, remove, or
  reframe an entry to support a litigation position will be declined and the
  fact of the request noted publicly. Corrections grounded in the text of a
  court order are welcome and will be logged in the changelog.
